# Brand-literal deny-list, read by scripts/brand-literal-guard.mjs.
#
# This public file only holds generic placeholders. Maintainers keep the real list (names of people,
# businesses, clients, handles and hosts that must never appear in the engine) in a private file
# outside the repository and point the guard at it:
#
#   ATTENTIONOS_DENYLIST=/path/to/private.deny node scripts/brand-literal-guard.mjs
#
# In CI the private list comes from a repository secret written to a temp file.
#
# Format: one entry per line. Plain text matches case-insensitively on word boundaries.
# Prefix with "re:" for a regular expression. Lines starting with "#" are comments.

replace-with-a-real-client-name
replace-with-a-real-business-name
re:\breplace-with-a-real-handle\b
